{
    "word": "enchanter",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "6ab899de-5aec-3984-881c-5e358d52c89b",
                "word": "enchanter",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "3ec56b85-f423-40a4-a025-d396f8b8dd55",
                        "entry_id": "6ab899de-5aec-3984-881c-5e358d52c89b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "enchanters"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f54c75e0-2a0a-3894-87a2-2f4d6205a006",
                        "entry_id": "6ab899de-5aec-3984-881c-5e358d52c89b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who enchants or delights."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "224584ee-11a0-4b07-8b9d-d376965cb3a7",
                                "sense_id": "f54c75e0-2a0a-3894-87a2-2f4d6205a006",
                                "text": "Robert Morse brings back to life the author, wit, bon vivant, self-pitier and true enchanter that was Truman Capote in this Tony-winning one-man performance […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1dd16c59-24f4-3889-9c45-8c506d39e02d",
                        "entry_id": "6ab899de-5aec-3984-881c-5e358d52c89b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A spellcaster, conjurer, wizard, sorcerer or soothsayer who specializes in enchantments."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "282550f4-54ac-46e6-9157-46870dfe8eaf",
                                "sense_id": "1dd16c59-24f4-3889-9c45-8c506d39e02d",
                                "text": "1590, Edmund Spenser, The Faerie Queene, Book One, Indianapolis: Hackett, 2006, Canto VII, stanza 35, p. 113,\nNo magicke arts hereof had any might, / Nor bloody wordes of bold Enchaunters call, / But all that was not such, as seemd in sight, / Before that shield did fade, and suddeine fall:"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac459f78-e29d-4501-bedb-67c9845686e9",
                                "sense_id": "1dd16c59-24f4-3889-9c45-8c506d39e02d",
                                "text": "He was indeed as bitter an enemy to the savage authority too often exercised by husbands and fathers, over the young and lovely of the other sex, as ever knight-errant was to the barbarous power of enchanters; nay, to say truth, I have often suspected that those very enchanters with which romance everywhere abounds were in reality no other than the husbands of those days; and matrimony itself was, perhaps, the enchanted castle in which the nymphs were said to be confined."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9779517c-7efd-4e29-bdd8-d1fa17d57288",
                                "sense_id": "1dd16c59-24f4-3889-9c45-8c506d39e02d",
                                "text": "[I]n the reign of Henry the Second, a body happening, by chance, to be dug up near Glastonbury Abbey, without any symptoms of putrefaction or decay, the Welch, the descendants of the Ancient Britons, tenacious of the dignity and reputation of that illustrious hero [King Arthur], vainly supposed it could be no other than the body of their justly-boasted Pen-Dragon; and that he had been immured in that sepulchre by the spells of some powerful and implacable inchanter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b24aa3cd-339d-4a92-b6eb-6ef2a71b5ec7",
                                "sense_id": "1dd16c59-24f4-3889-9c45-8c506d39e02d",
                                "text": "Thou from whose unseen presence the leaves dead / Are driven like ghosts from an enchanter fleeing,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f912826-f498-4f04-8412-d6c26568b01e",
                                "sense_id": "1dd16c59-24f4-3889-9c45-8c506d39e02d",
                                "text": "[…] Goldstein […] seemed like some sinister enchanter, capable by the mere power of his voice of wrecking the structure of civilization."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e165df2-a69c-4b57-ae4d-291c326d4b3b",
                        "source_entry_id": "6ab899de-5aec-3984-881c-5e358d52c89b",
                        "source_sense_description": "A spellcaster, conjurer, wizard, sorcerer or soothsayer",
                        "target_lang_word": "enchanteur",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "enchanteur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "860eeb63-9f6a-3235-9e61-63829253a6af",
                                        "entry_id": "2f242d9e-552c-3796-8b83-7608dc88e316",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Charmeur, ensorcelant, magique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7ac077e-c756-4db1-86f1-9508ad76a62e",
                                                "sense_id": "860eeb63-9f6a-3235-9e61-63829253a6af",
                                                "text": "Quel dénouement prosaïque allez-vous chercher aux fantaisies enchanteresses de votre jeune enthousiasme ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51376530-6f78-440f-b4e5-977ad82a94e2",
                                                "sense_id": "860eeb63-9f6a-3235-9e61-63829253a6af",
                                                "text": "Les rives de l’Orange offraient toujours le même aspect enchanteur."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "377b1955-bf41-4679-9532-d53a09e2ee5d",
                                                "sense_id": "860eeb63-9f6a-3235-9e61-63829253a6af",
                                                "text": "Démocrite aurait trouvé aux rives du Jourdain et aux grèves de la mer Morte un aspect enchanteur."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "enchanteur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33a7508a-1c1f-3679-b472-eddf4dab7656",
                                        "entry_id": "f9f20c68-cb56-3c28-bc5f-6491de46e37a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui est réputée pratiquer des enchantements."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb3aa0a1-8089-4888-a516-3a2ca7e69f0e",
                                                "sense_id": "33a7508a-1c1f-3679-b472-eddf4dab7656",
                                                "text": "Sur les tréteaux l'arlequin blême\nSalue d'abord les spectateurs\nDes sorciers venus de Bohême\nQuelques fées et les enchanteurs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0247ff61-223a-4d3a-8d54-32976f3c6796",
                                                "sense_id": "33a7508a-1c1f-3679-b472-eddf4dab7656",
                                                "text": "Les enchanteurs s'évanouirent frappés à mort, et je vis de loin leurs livres de magie brûler comme une torche dans le noir clocher."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20b9e0a6-ec95-3023-8df1-97613680b665",
                                        "entry_id": "f9f20c68-cb56-3c28-bc5f-6491de46e37a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne dont le beau langage, les manières séduisantes peuvent charmer, tromper."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45039033-ef5a-4b3d-81b4-c657c239c2da",
                                                "sense_id": "20b9e0a6-ec95-3023-8df1-97613680b665",
                                                "text": "[…] ; et plus vous vous étendrez sur votre passion, plus il se hâtera de la terminer par la mort de la belle enchanteresse ; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9f86ff7-f4a7-4124-b962-3831b6428442",
                                                "sense_id": "20b9e0a6-ec95-3023-8df1-97613680b665",
                                                "text": "Comme un jeune premier qui s'éveille dans le jardin d'une magicienne, je faillis soupirer : « Où suis-je ? » car mon enchanteresse demeurait immobile et je ne savais pas bien où j'étais entré."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "466b6da3-6ab6-3b0f-ae84-6b15c8e92b5e",
                                        "entry_id": "f9f20c68-cb56-3c28-bc5f-6491de46e37a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui dont l’astuce et l’ingéniosité le rendent comparable à un magicien dans ses talents et inventions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1ede8ad-ce62-4454-8866-508a40594a0f",
                                                "sense_id": "466b6da3-6ab6-3b0f-ae84-6b15c8e92b5e",
                                                "text": "Le Mage Dédale et Icare, son fils, ont été enfermés dans le Labyrinthe de Crète par Minos, roi de l’Île, qui redoute le pouvoir de l’Enchanteur."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fcc60a9a-7aa8-48c0-a478-5b3b466ff96b",
                        "source_entry_id": "6ab899de-5aec-3984-881c-5e358d52c89b",
                        "source_sense_description": "A spellcaster, conjurer, wizard, sorcerer or soothsayer",
                        "target_lang_word": "enchanteuse",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "enchanteuse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e0dd5e5-e6dd-3786-961a-9e01a93ff787",
                                        "entry_id": "ee01e607-a25e-371b-a55a-ad0067582b45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Variante de enchanteresse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be02347e-a1a4-4875-9bf7-f2a8743f9f59",
                                                "sense_id": "0e0dd5e5-e6dd-3786-961a-9e01a93ff787",
                                                "text": "— Sorcière, enchanteuse, démone ! s’écria-t-il. Je vous adjure, par la puissance divine, de vous en aller — si vous êtes défunte, à la tombe — si vous êtes damnée, en enfer !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "enchanteuse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1872b05-6bde-3ba9-b61f-e712cea34756",
                                        "entry_id": "2eabb1ac-dc25-3e10-b7e4-83942ed262b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Féminin singulier de enchanteur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d2f5287-6709-4ccb-a3b3-e3ca8b28a3f9",
                                                "sense_id": "d1872b05-6bde-3ba9-b61f-e712cea34756",
                                                "text": "La Grèce enchanteuse nous entraîne aux fêtes magiques de la vie et donne à ses mystères la séduction de ses formes tour à tour charmantes ou terribles, de son âme toujours passionnée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b2792df7-5b1b-4be1-946a-87887f861d88",
                        "source_entry_id": "6ab899de-5aec-3984-881c-5e358d52c89b",
                        "source_sense_description": "A spellcaster, conjurer, wizard, sorcerer or soothsayer",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zauberer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Zauberer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64ef3de1-be4c-3b71-9fb1-2afa8f5456be",
                                        "entry_id": "3a2a1c87-7998-330e-ab0a-15a4c85a8620",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "meist männliche Person mit magischen Fähigkeiten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffb2adec-3073-49e3-8e29-6d95b34a92ec",
                                                "sense_id": "64ef3de1-be4c-3b71-9fb1-2afa8f5456be",
                                                "text": "Nur ein Zauberer wäre fähig, unsichtbar zu werden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f2d29f4-a71b-4547-ab8d-07d613795bdf",
                                                "sense_id": "64ef3de1-be4c-3b71-9fb1-2afa8f5456be",
                                                "text": "„Er will mit dem Zauberer Rücksprache halten, ob er auch ohne einen Slip seine Kräfte wirken lassen könne.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd3473dc-1ee8-4b22-8432-4dba55d6826d",
                                                "sense_id": "64ef3de1-be4c-3b71-9fb1-2afa8f5456be",
                                                "text": "„Wären die wenigen Silben der Bannfluch eines Zauberers gewesen, nach denen Mrs. Breidelford von nun an viertausend Jahre unbeweglich auf dem Platz stehenbleiben sollte, wäre die würdige Lady nicht mehr erschrocken.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6af44ff4-aa41-43be-be92-f5e04625abfe",
                                                "sense_id": "64ef3de1-be4c-3b71-9fb1-2afa8f5456be",
                                                "text": "„Natürlich findet er sie und kehrt in Papageiengestalt bei ihr ein – es ist Lila, die sich in der Gefangenschaft eines sehr alten, sehr verliebten Zauberers befindet.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e292969-033f-3f49-83fa-dea326acbc86",
                                        "entry_id": "3a2a1c87-7998-330e-ab0a-15a4c85a8620",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand, der Zaubertricks aufführt, um Menschen zu unterhalten; Zauberkünstler"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "308a9fa2-58d3-4789-8e23-bdc40dc6e2cc",
                                                "sense_id": "5e292969-033f-3f49-83fa-dea326acbc86",
                                                "text": "Wir haben einen Zauberer eingestellt, der in unserem Restaurant die Kunden unterhält."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e81515c-7587-4620-ad5a-960b7921986e",
                                                "sense_id": "5e292969-033f-3f49-83fa-dea326acbc86",
                                                "text": "„Ein Herr namens Christopher Roller verklagte die beiden berühmtesten Zauberer David Blaine und David Copperfield auf die Herausgabe ihrer Berufsgeheimnisse.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
